== 2A.2  b = (4, 3) onto a = (1, 2)
a.b = 10.0  a.a = 5.0  c = 2.0
p = [2. 4.]  r = [ 2. -1.]  a.r = 0.0  p.r = 0.0
Pythagoras: |b|^2 = 25.0  |p|^2 + |r|^2 = 25.0 ( 20.0 + 5.0 )
any other multiple is worse: c = 1.5 gives |b - c a|^2 = 6.25  c = 2 gives 5.0

